boomerang (0.7.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Covalence is renamed Boomerang: app id io.github.melvincouwez.Boomerang,
    daemon boomerangd, package boomerang (Provides, Conflicts and Replaces
    covalence), new icon (raisin to raspberry boomerang).
  * Migration at the first start: ~/.config, ~/.local/share, ~/.local/state
    and ~/.local/libexec folders, sound ids, keyring key, iCloud Drive and
    Photos units, launchers and icons of the old name, GTK bookmarks,
    mimeapps.list, dock launchers, notification settings, browser host.
    iCloud sources keep their covalence-icloud uids.
  * Each release also carries a covalence package with the same files, so
    Covalence 0.6 updates itself to Boomerang.

