covalence (0.2.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * First public alpha release.
  * Renamed from Tandem to Covalence; covalenced moves the settings, cache,
    keyring key, user units and old launchers of a Tandem install on its
    first start.
  * Works on elementary OS 8 and 9: calls need PipeWire 1.4 or later and are
    shown as unavailable otherwise; rclone is downloaded on request when the
    system copy is missing or too old.

